<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble unchanged at 15,100 in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble unchanged at 15,100 in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble was unchanged at 15,100 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    November 15	 November 14</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,100		15,100</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $3.645 million	  $2.779 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
